  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aSmCp8G.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1484\" height=\"957\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>「歡迎來到佛萊迪·費斯熊的披薩店，一個充滿魔法的地方，讓幻想與樂趣化為現實！」</em></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_banner1.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"103\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">這個模組將《佛萊迪餐館之五夜驚魂》的恐怖帶入你的Minecraft世界！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">此模組包含了來自該系列的角色</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">基於所有FNaF作品的自訂結構</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">以及可運作的監視器！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">更多功能即將推出！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">與Bisect Hosting正式合作！使用優惠碼：DevMultiverse，首次購買可享75折優惠。</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"628\" height=\"131\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/The_Five_Nights_at_Freddys_Mod/BH_TFNAFM_banner2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ke2bF9f8TE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_8c61b755-377c-4369-9110-a816f4d50f16.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"178\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/MephilisDevMultiverse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_1edb5a8c-e8ae-4dbb-a2e8-90f884f4f296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"168\" height=\"52\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/ModFnaf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/513493/description_5b07a4bb-dd4e-44bd-a8fb-427c6b21efc3.png\